     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Discussed on Oct 26th committer meeting.  Need some more detail from Eddie on licensing and technology (svn vs git) on fedora-client.  Kai says svn and having it managed alongside the fcrepo project is fine for fedora-cli.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
